    "name": "Hired Stars",
    "steam_appid": 3628010,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/e15e24dd4359f3da83b5fcc1a0b89f0a.poster.avif?t=1754465822\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/e15e24dd4359f3da83b5fcc1a0b89f0a.webm?t=1754465822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/e15e24dd4359f3da83b5fcc1a0b89f0a.mp4?t=1754465822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HIRED STARS offers an open, procedurally generated universe to travel through as an adventurer, mercenary, pirate or however you wish. In search of weapons, ships, loot, money and power. This really is great fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/526af56b52caf23953e008855b36b9dd.poster.avif?t=1754465822\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/526af56b52caf23953e008855b36b9dd.webp?t=1754465822\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=50 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/b837bbc1e0bcbd3923e865df8acba8f9.webp?t=1754465822\" width=616 height=38 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recruit And Level Captains</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit captains, they gain experience and can level up to gain new traits. They become stronger and better.\u00a0And they reveal more about themselves and the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/7237462173a6260bc909b11711ed1f95.avif?t=1754465822\" width=652 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Travel the Strategic Map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Targets can be identified and attacked on the strategic map. Raiding and plundering are the main focus in order to obtain new weapons, ships and loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/5adee1d17c22b5170ecde7506d6c64a0.poster.avif?t=1754465822\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/5adee1d17c22b5170ecde7506d6c64a0.webm?t=1754465822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/5adee1d17c22b5170ecde7506d6c64a0.mp4?t=1754465822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tough Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct combat takes place in real time. Positioning determines success. Dodge incoming projectiles and rockets and open fire on the enemy while they are weak and vulnerable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/75c8ffa743e8603d2d1bed2a34f7fd3c.poster.avif?t=1754465822\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/75c8ffa743e8603d2d1bed2a34f7fd3c.webm?t=1754465822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/75c8ffa743e8603d2d1bed2a34f7fd3c.mp4?t=1754465822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Equip &amp; Refit Your Ships</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip the ships as you see fit! Make them stronger and customize them to your liking! Better ships, more raids, more loot! More action, more fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/64ff5eb267bd15e5a7794add4c1f587b.avif?t=1754465822\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/e2dc087b70c82af193aafc62b9064f57.avif?t=1754465822\" width=616 height=312 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Eradicate Your Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The opponents are not resting. They hunt without mercy and strike when they can! Only their ruthless extermination ensures victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/5dc26d9340d286e93d3f1fceeac02975.avif?t=1754465822\" width=616 height=164 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore The Universe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe is alive, it is evolving. Cargo fleets are flying around, trading. Patrols search for enemies. Battle fleets chase the enemy!\u00a0There is a lot to discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/0841a6cc34eaf949d51abd765225a5a5.avif?t=1754465822\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game is hard! The open world is very challenging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No aliens! No shields! No shiny effects or magic technology. Maybe just a little.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open, living, randomly generated universe!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different factions with strengths  and loot!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diplomacy system, make allies or enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decrypting captured data cores for quests and informations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Very high replayability due to generator and rogue shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All ships, weapons, etc. are scripts (modding).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The crucial black market!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/9a1f3bbbedc1116ef2d23f7e44918bdd.poster.avif?t=1754465822\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/9a1f3bbbedc1116ef2d23f7e44918bdd.webm?t=1754465822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/9a1f3bbbedc1116ef2d23f7e44918bdd.mp4?t=1754465822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/b837bbc1e0bcbd3923e865df8acba8f9.webp?t=1754465822\" width=616 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/c066787476765ba150decd0e3b27657a.poster.avif?t=1754465822\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/c066787476765ba150decd0e3b27657a.webp?t=1754465822\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=150 /></picture></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/e15e24dd4359f3da83b5fcc1a0b89f0a.poster.avif?t=1754465822\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/e15e24dd4359f3da83b5fcc1a0b89f0a.webm?t=1754465822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/e15e24dd4359f3da83b5fcc1a0b89f0a.mp4?t=1754465822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HIRED STARS offers an open, procedurally generated universe to travel through as an adventurer, mercenary, pirate or however you wish. In search of weapons, ships, loot, money and power. This really is great fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/526af56b52caf23953e008855b36b9dd.poster.avif?t=1754465822\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/526af56b52caf23953e008855b36b9dd.webp?t=1754465822\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=50 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/b837bbc1e0bcbd3923e865df8acba8f9.webp?t=1754465822\" width=616 height=38 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recruit And Level Captains</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit captains, they gain experience and can level up to gain new traits. They become stronger and better.\u00a0And they reveal more about themselves and the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/7237462173a6260bc909b11711ed1f95.avif?t=1754465822\" width=652 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Travel the Strategic Map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Targets can be identified and attacked on the strategic map. Raiding and plundering are the main focus in order to obtain new weapons, ships and loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/5adee1d17c22b5170ecde7506d6c64a0.poster.avif?t=1754465822\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/5adee1d17c22b5170ecde7506d6c64a0.webm?t=1754465822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/5adee1d17c22b5170ecde7506d6c64a0.mp4?t=1754465822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tough Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct combat takes place in real time. Positioning determines success. Dodge incoming projectiles and rockets and open fire on the enemy while they are weak and vulnerable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/75c8ffa743e8603d2d1bed2a34f7fd3c.poster.avif?t=1754465822\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/75c8ffa743e8603d2d1bed2a34f7fd3c.webm?t=1754465822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/75c8ffa743e8603d2d1bed2a34f7fd3c.mp4?t=1754465822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Equip &amp; Refit Your Ships</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip the ships as you see fit! Make them stronger and customize them to your liking! Better ships, more raids, more loot! More action, more fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/64ff5eb267bd15e5a7794add4c1f587b.avif?t=1754465822\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/e2dc087b70c82af193aafc62b9064f57.avif?t=1754465822\" width=616 height=312 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Eradicate Your Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The opponents are not resting. They hunt without mercy and strike when they can! Only their ruthless extermination ensures victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/5dc26d9340d286e93d3f1fceeac02975.avif?t=1754465822\" width=616 height=164 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore The Universe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe is alive, it is evolving. Cargo fleets are flying around, trading. Patrols search for enemies. Battle fleets chase the enemy!\u00a0There is a lot to discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/0841a6cc34eaf949d51abd765225a5a5.avif?t=1754465822\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game is hard! The open world is very challenging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No aliens! No shields! No shiny effects or magic technology. Maybe just a little.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open, living, randomly generated universe!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different factions with strengths  and loot!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diplomacy system, make allies or enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decrypting captured data cores for quests and informations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Very high replayability due to generator and rogue shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All ships, weapons, etc. are scripts (modding).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The crucial black market!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/9a1f3bbbedc1116ef2d23f7e44918bdd.poster.avif?t=1754465822\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/9a1f3bbbedc1116ef2d23f7e44918bdd.webm?t=1754465822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/9a1f3bbbedc1116ef2d23f7e44918bdd.mp4?t=1754465822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/b837bbc1e0bcbd3923e865df8acba8f9.webp?t=1754465822\" width=616 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/c066787476765ba150decd0e3b27657a.poster.avif?t=1754465822\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628010/extras/c066787476765ba150decd0e3b27657a.webp?t=1754465822\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=150 /></picture></span></p>",
    "short_description": "HIRED STARS is an isometric single player RTS game in an open, randomly generated sandbox universe. You take control of a small mercenary force. Plunder trade routes, attack pirates, fight the Empire or follow the story. Conquer or buy new ships and equipment. Recruit new captains and level them.",
